 encountered provider-overload errors. Coverage reached 108/129 dynamic-access sites (83.72%), while metrics remained `failure` with no finalized generated LOC or metadata artifact.\n\nPlease inspect:\n- `logs/do-work-20261018-172551.log`\n- `logs/com.alibaba:druid:1.2.28/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-10-19T07-21-35-397182Z.log`\n- `logs/com.alibaba:druid:1.2.28/issue-requested-metadata/pi-generation-2026-10-19T07-21-32-801362Z.log`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. On the preserved branch, configure the native test binary with `-H:+AddAllCharsets` (matching existing repository tests) so Druid’s `GBK` initialization succeeds.\n2. Run `./gradlew test -Pcoordinates=com.alibaba:druid:1.2.28` and confirm all 24 JVM/native tests pass.\n3. Review the generated metadata and the 21 remaining uncovered dynamic-access sites, then regenerate/finalize the stats and execution metrics before publication.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_03e662e58cfb5aad016ad5c59e85a487d084946ae9e1efb922\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 14270, "output": 937, "cacheRead": 139008, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 516, "totalTokens": 154215, "cost": {"input": 0.05708, "output": 0.018740000000000003, "cacheRead": 0.055603200000000005, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.13142320000000002}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1792394634080, "responseId": "resp_03e662e58cfb5aad016ad5c58aa83087d083327851a120d231", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
